Unfortunately, matrix C is stored on a column-major basis!
Before linalg_cholesky, the matrix is stored on a row-major basis,
After  linalg_cholesky, the matrix is stored on a col-major basis.
The storage sequence of matrix elements has changed and is inconsistent after linalg_cholesky. It's not normal.
